{
  "url": "https://www.facebook.com/shawn.arndt.1000/posts/pfbid02J5rHFze5uMsvkDCti38BRHH6C61u3t2jH6uyAHjFa4x31sg6GUHdZQDT8qFnxAobl",
  "timestamp": 1792327474000,
  "postText": "Did you know that the sale of Nicotine vapes are banned beginning at 12:01am Monday. October 19 in PA? If you get caught selling any vape it is a $1,500 fine for each ITEM!!!! The State is allowing the sale of “CROSSBAR” vapes, but only four flavors. I checked into this company, and seems as though they are government backed. There main business resource has been sales of vapes to States for the purpose of being the electronic cigarette provider for prisons and detention centers. If this is such a free country, which IT’S NOT, why weren’t we the People able to vote on this? This is what the cigarette manufacturers wanted because the sales of cigarettes has dropped 65% or more since all the Vape companies got in the game. What are your thoughts?",
